{
  "title": "Greek Lemon Herb Chicken and Quinoa Meal Prep Bowls",
  "description": "Greek lemon herb chicken and quinoa meal prep bowls deliver 35 grams of protein per serving in just 25 minutes. Fresh lemon, garlic, and oregano flavor tender chicken breast paired with protein-packed quinoa and crisp cucumbers.",
  "cuisine": "Mediterranean",
  "category": "Lunch",
